[I] Python audio file I/O and resampling classes

[T] Zita-audiotools provides Python classes to read and write audio files to
[T] and from numpy arrays and to resample audio, based on the zita-resampler
[T] library.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

